<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa gold output falls to 39.81 tonnes in July.</title>
<headline>S.Africa gold output falls to 39.81 tonnes in July.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold output fell in July to 39,808.0 kilos from June's 41,674.5 kilos, Chamber of Mines figures show.  </p>
<p>Detailed figures in kilos (ozs in brackets) -</p>
<p> July 1997    June 1997    July 1996    Jan-July 97  Jan-July 96</p>
<p>  39,808.0     41,674.5     39,979.3    281,389.4    287,075.9</p>
<p>  (1.28 mln)   (1.34 mln)   (1.29 mln)  (9.05 mln)   (9.23 mln)</p>
</text>
